{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/be71970b43988faa9f775a0f563406d9.avif?t=1774410711\" width=700 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite the Eggo to live on your and your friends' screens~ (\u1422\uff61\u2022\u02d5\u2022\uff61\u1422)! Hang out with friends while your adorable Eggo keeps you company, making every day a unique day! Every \u201cclack\u201d of your keyboard is motivation for it to hunt for treasures! Here, you'll be Eggo's family, accompanying it through its entire life journey\u2014from hatching, growing up, traveling, until it falling in love and starting a family!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/34183567bdf2cf6b005212e5e90384bf.poster.avif?t=1774410711\" width=860 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/34183567bdf2cf6b005212e5e90384bf.webm?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/34183567bdf2cf6b005212e5e90384bf.mp4?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/9a301b5336533990a7a116c48dc10aa4.avif?t=1774410711\" width=700 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join friends in raising and caring for Eggo! It all begins with adopting an Eggo egg. Witness firsthand as it cracks open, from the first tiny fissure to the shell shattering completely! The moment that adorable Eggo hatches, it's all yours~ Not only can you feed and care for this little creature, but you can become its chosen caretaker and family!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/15997886ccfe7e99cd565336e2234e5e.poster.avif?t=1774410711\" width=860 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/15997886ccfe7e99cd565336e2234e5e.webm?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/15997886ccfe7e99cd565336e2234e5e.mp4?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/4f040d4a4cf847f81de23fc044e4adec.avif?t=1774410711\" width=700 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can also scout out an ideal partner for your adorable Eggo! You can even act as a parent and communicate with your friends to arrange a satisfying match for your Eggos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When two Eggos with mutual affection meet, a brand-new Eggo Egg is born~ Guess which parent's traits the new little Eggo will inherit? You might even unlock super-rare hidden genes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come witness this delightful new life together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/f5a4ff6b58418c62db8ccb4bd6c77387.poster.avif?t=1774410711\" width=860 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/f5a4ff6b58418c62db8ccb4bd6c77387.webm?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/f5a4ff6b58418c62db8ccb4bd6c77387.mp4?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/6c1dcc4c94707602be5f8693958de503.avif?t=1774410711\" width=700 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 outfits and appearances to mix and match! Like opening a blind box, choose its ear shape, eye color, fur... Every style you personally design becomes a warm memory just between you two! Each combination unlocks your collection album and crafts your very own dreamy, adorable companion! Your imagination is its magic\u2014make it the most extraordinary companion in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/6812e23c2c45e86dc926a00999bd4127.poster.avif?t=1774410711\" width=860 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/6812e23c2c45e86dc926a00999bd4127.webm?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/6812e23c2c45e86dc926a00999bd4127.mp4?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/1f2fa5a207ba17bc7c4c7ab456c617cb.avif?t=1774410711\" width=700 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your tender care, Eggo will evolve from a fluffy little ball into an independent traveler carrying a small backpack, collecting rare treasures from different planets right in the corner of your screen! All these treasures can be exchanged for sparkling gold coins! Use these coins to buy new things for Eggo! From stylish outfits to cozy furniture, quickly decorate Eggo and its home to your liking~ Doesn't seeing Eggo wearing adorable clothes in its new home give you a huge sense of accomplishment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/ef293d189b37aa152dc2008a24c35b9a.poster.avif?t=1774410711\" width=860 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/ef293d189b37aa152dc2008a24c35b9a.webm?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/ef293d189b37aa152dc2008a24c35b9a.mp4?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Weight of Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700760/af9fefb5dbfdc26e57ed734594922ecdc88d0ed7.jpg"},{"name":"Greatness of Everyday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700760/659c1244c9d40bc2ee5a4743564c9a93ba79d2a4.jpg"},{"name":"Eggo Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700760/91bb5ffc1d37bdaaac96be8e9ed917b504a0bdac.jpg"},{"name":"The Birth of a Caretaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700760/0ca41f57ce99d1015402d83aa8ad34c78ee696dd.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Janitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700760/096a5b2eb1c5c1833230c20ea6eb2fbbcdda4675.jpg"},{"name":"Dinner Time!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700760/82e2846096ca8b58d91b9e90bc7c1caf4d778176.jpg"},{"name":"Five-Star Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700760/4d6f6f658104640ee721cbfab49e66f5dc476821.jpg"},{"name":"Healing Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700760/fc8a8388139d287789dca4a04c226e9c42c377b2.jpg"},{"name":"Glory of the Toilet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700760/78ac777febff2e89f18d151351f4482fe0e2908a.jpg"},{"name":"Automation Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700760/7ec215bc5495f5b231fd40c7268b051cada6cec0.jpg"}],"total":49},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700760?t=1774410711","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700760?t=1774410711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/2401cfb08d4820abe88260a5ec18f0d405a4216b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774410711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/2401cfb08d4820abe88260a5ec18f0d405a4216b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774410711","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Welcome to Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/fd416fcaeca60a080f16d8c930d221ef.avif?t=1774410711\" width=600 height=129 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1