tle creature, but you can become its chosen caretaker and family!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/15997886ccfe7e99cd565336e2234e5e.poster.avif?t=1774410711\" width=860 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/15997886ccfe7e99cd565336e2234e5e.webm?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/15997886ccfe7e99cd565336e2234e5e.mp4?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/4f040d4a4cf847f81de23fc044e4adec.avif?t=1774410711\" width=700 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can also scout out an ideal partner for your adorable Eggo! You can even act as a parent and communicate with your friends to arrange a satisfying match for your Eggos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When two Eggos with mutual affection meet, a brand-new Eggo Egg is born~ Guess which parent's traits the new little Eggo will inherit? You might even unlock super-rare hidden genes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come witness this delightful new life together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/f5a4ff6b58418c62db8ccb4bd6c77387.poster.avif?t=1774410711\" width=860 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/f5a4ff6b58418c62db8ccb4bd6c77387.webm?t=1774410711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst